sequenceDiagram
    participant UI
    participant J as Jobs Service

    Note over UI: after receiving 202 from push or inspect
    loop every 2 s (max 60 s)
        UI->>J: GET /api/jobs/{jobId}
        alt status: running
            J-->>UI: { jobId, type: "push"|"inspect", status: "running", result: null }
            Note over UI: keep spinner active
        else status: done
            J-->>UI: { jobId, type, status: "done", result: { … } }
            Note over UI: stop polling; apply result to UI
        else status: error
            J-->>UI: { jobId, type, status: "error", error: "message" }
            Note over UI: stop polling; show error toast
        else jobId not found
            J-->>UI: 404
            Note over UI: treat as error; stop polling
        end
    end
    Note over UI: timeout after 60 s — show "Operation taking too long" toast